        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "A standard professional roof inspection in Utah typically costs between $150 and $300, with a statewide average around $230. However, many local roofing contractors offer free inspections if you are seeking a repair or replacement estimate.",
        "snippet_highlighted_words": [
          "between $150 and $300"
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          0,
          1,
          2,
          3
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Cost Breakdown by Inspection Type"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "Prices vary depending on whether you hire an independent inspector for a formal report or a contractor for a repair quote, as well as the technology used:",
        "reference_indexes": [
          2,
          4
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Key Factors That Affect Utah Pricing"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Location & Snow Load. Inspections in high-elevation or mountain areas like Park City often run higher ($150 to $600) due to steeper roof pitches and the need to check for ice dam and freeze-thaw damage .",
            "reference_indexes": [
              1
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Home Size & Stories. A standard single-story home falls on the lower end of the price range, while two-story homes or properties over 2,500 square feet require more time and safety equipment.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              0,
              1
            ]
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Formal Certifications. If you need an official roof certification for an insurance policy or home sale, expect to pay an additional $75 to $200 on top of the base inspection fee.",
            "reference_indexes": [
              5
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "To give you a more exact estimate, let me know:"
      },
